{"seq":1,"slug":"mechanics-review","title":"九年级物理 — 力学复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/comprehensive-physics/mechanics-review","wordCount":1223,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"九年级物理-力学复习\">九年级物理 — 力学复习</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>力学是初中物理的基础板块，在中考中占比约30%。九年级总复习需要系统梳理力、运动、力与运动的关系、压强和浮力等核心知识。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>知识板块</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n<th>中考题型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>力与运动</td>\n<td>牛顿第一定律、二力平衡</td>\n<td>选择题、实验题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压强</td>\n<td>固体压强、液体压强、大气压</td>\n<td>计算题、实验题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浮力</td>\n<td>阿基米德原理、浮沉条件</td>\n<td>计算题、综合题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>简单机械</td>\n<td>杠杆、滑轮、机械效率</td>\n<td>计算题、实验题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>力学复习的关键是理清概念之间的逻辑关系，建立&quot;力—运动—功—能&quot;的知识链条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"力与运动\">力与运动</h3><p>牛顿第一定律（惯性定律）：一切物体在没有受到外力作用时，总保持静止状态或匀速直线运动状态。惯性是物体保持原有运动状态的性质，质量越大惯性越大。</p>\n<p>二力平衡的条件：大小相等、方向相反、作用在同一物体上、作用在同一直线上。物体受平衡力作用时保持静止或匀速直线运动。</p>\n<p>力与运动的关系：力不是维持运动的原因，而是改变运动状态的原因。</p>\n<h3 id=\"压强复习\">压强复习</h3><p>固体压强：p = F/S，增大压强的方法是增大压力或减小受力面积。减小压强的方法相反。</p>\n<p>液体压强：p = ρgh，液体压强只与液体密度和深度有关，与容器形状和液体总量无关。</p>\n<p>大气压强：标准大气压约为1.013×<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> Pa，可支撑约10.3m高的水柱或约760mm高的汞柱。托里拆利实验测定了大气压的值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"浮力复习\">浮力复习</h3><p>浮力的产生原因：液体对物体上下表面的压力差。</p>\n<p>阿基米德原理：浸在液体中的物体受到的浮力等于它排开的液体所受的重力。F浮 = ρ液gV排。</p>\n<p>物体的浮沉条件：F浮 &gt; G 上浮，F浮 = G 悬浮，F浮 &lt; G 下沉。漂浮时 F浮 = G，且 V排 &lt; V物。</p>\n<h3 id=\"简单机械与机械效率\">简单机械与机械效率</h3><p>杠杆平衡条件：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1L_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_2L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。根据动力臂与阻力臂的关系分为省力杠杆、费力杠杆和等臂杠杆。</p>\n<p>滑轮：定滑轮改变力的方向但不省力；动滑轮省一半力但不改变方向；滑轮组可以既省力又改变方向。</p>\n<p>机械效率：η = W有/W总 × 100%。机械效率总是小于100%（因为有额外功）。提高机械效率的方法：减小摩擦、减轻机械自重。</p>\n<h3 id=\"力学综合计算\">力学综合计算</h3><p>力学综合题常将压强、浮力和简单机械结合起来考查。解题思路：先分析物体受力（重力、浮力、支持力、拉力等），再利用平衡条件列方程求解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>一个质量为500g的物体放在水平桌面上，与桌面的接触面积为<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.01</mn><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.01m^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，求桌面受到的压强。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>一个物体的体积为<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200cm^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，密度为0.8g/<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cm^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，放入水中后是漂浮还是下沉？求浮力和露出水面的体积。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>用一个动滑轮提起重为100N的物体，不计绳重和摩擦，需要多大的力？实际拉力为60N时，机械效率是多少？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>中考综合：一个底面积为<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100cm^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>的容器中装有水，将一个质量为0.5kg的物体缓慢放入水中，物体漂浮。求水面上升的高度。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>力学是物理学的基石，从伽利略的自由落体实验到牛顿的三大定律，力学的发展推动了整个物理学的进步。在日常生活中，力学原理无处不在：自行车的刹车利用了摩擦力，高压锅利用了气压与沸点的关系，轮船利用了浮力原理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>力学复习要构建&quot;力—运动—功—能&quot;的知识体系。重点掌握牛顿第一定律、压强公式、阿基米德原理和杠杆平衡条件，学会力学综合计算的受力分析方法。做到&quot;概念清晰、公式准确、分析有序、计算规范&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"energy-review\">能量复习</a> —— 力学的&quot;功&quot;是能量转化的量度，机械能守恒与杠杆、滑轮的机械效率衔接到能量板块。</li>\n<li>同 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"experiment-skills\">实验技能</a> —— 探究杠杆平衡条件、测密度等都是力学高频实验，复习时应配合实验方法一并梳理。</li>\n<li>跨 hub（八年级物理·力学）：<a href=\"../../../grade-8/physics/mechanics/pressure-buoyancy\">压强与浮力</a> —— 本节的力学综合计算大量复用八年级压强、阿基米德原理的原始推导，回看源头能补齐概念漏洞。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"九年级物理 — 力学复习","id":"九年级物理-力学复习"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"力与运动","id":"力与运动"},{"level":3,"text":"压强复习","id":"压强复习"},{"level":3,"text":"浮力复习","id":"浮力复习"},{"level":3,"text":"简单机械与机械效率","id":"简单机械与机械效率"},{"level":3,"text":"力学综合计算","id":"力学综合计算"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"九年级物理 — 电磁波","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/magnetism-waves/electromagnetic-waves"},"next":{"title":"九年级物理 — 能量复习","url":"/l-doc-books/education/middle-school/grade-9/physics/comprehensive-physics/energy-review"}}